---
source: src/actors/workflows/plan.rs
expression: out
---
# Living room plant dry  (on: plant(living-room-plant).soil_moisture Lt 20)
  notify: notify(AndroidApp, general): Living room plant is dry (soil moisture below 20%)

# Living room plant overwatered  (on: plant(living-room-plant).soil_moisture Gt 80)
  notify: notify(AndroidApp, general): Living room plant is overwatered (soil moisture above 80%)

# Living room plant water and fertilise  (on: cron(0 9 * * 0))
  notify: notify(AndroidApp, general): Water and fertilise the living room plant
